{
  "name": "W4 \u00b7 Follow-up \u2014 Electrical contractor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W4 \u2014 Follow-up \u00b7 Electrical contractor\n\n**Boundary: automated, with a hard stop the moment a human replies.**\nLow consequence per message, but the failure mode is reputational and compounding, so the stop condition is absolute rather than probabilistic. Scored 2/3/5.\n\n### Three touches. Ever.\nDay 3, day 7, day 14, then it escalates to the owner and the sequence ends. A fourth automated message is not follow-up, it is harassment \u2014 and in a town this size the business cannot afford it.\n\n### Confound warning\nWin rate will move and you will want to claim it. Don't. At n\u224825 you cannot separate the sequence from market conditions. Report **touches delivered vs intended** \u2014 that one is clean, and it is the thing the automation actually changed.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "39dc7d2d-2c12-47c3-bdae-09568c40e8f7",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -840,
        -380
      ]
    },
